# Wave W17-L (Meadowbrook Woods): silk oak — a tall silk oak of the deep woods, crown in the darkest greens of the fleet with pale cascoon pods hanging in it, drawn in the tree art (design: SILKWURM and their cascoons in the branches), on shade turf (ground baked in). Split from Yamato’s hollytree by the hanging pods and the shade register.
